The home side's start records disagree with its bline and dline records. They
put Frank McCoy in slot 7 with no position and Marvin Barker in slot 8, and
omit Flash Miller. The bline records have McCoy replacing Johnny Hayes in
slot 6 (McCoy's only dline is the second catcher), Barker first in slot 7, and
Miller first in slot 8 at second base (27 outs). The start records are
rebuilt from the first bline in each slot and that player's dline position.

--- a/ngl_b/1935.EBR
+++ b/ngl_b/1935.EBR
@@ -39,4 +39,4 @@
 start,hayej104,"Johnny Hayes",1,6,2
-start,mccof102,"Frank McCoy",1,7,
-start,barkm101,"Marvin Barker",1,8,9
+start,barkm101,"Marvin Barker",1,7,9
+start,millf106,"Flash Miller",1,8,4
 start,craih101,"Homer Craig",1,9,1
